    "458b40a14174aaad9a56",
    "fbf81c91f0d28a874ff4"
   ],
   "duration": 9.572,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Time to design an API.",
     "start": 0.15,
     "end": 2.21
    },
    {
     "text": "Checksum reads every byte, and the caller keeps using the batch afterwards.",
     "start": 2.63,
     "end": 6.61
    },
    {
     "text": "Which signature would you ship?",
